    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist the full game</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now wishlist the full game on Steam!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/b04cd96538d31c6b089c56f9733c0d30.poster.avif?t=1729345841\" width=618 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/b04cd96538d31c6b089c56f9733c0d30.webm?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/b04cd96538d31c6b089c56f9733c0d30.mp4?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Congratulations! We have accepted your bid to redevelop Block #27343 inside Novo Stappelstad! This site is truly a blank slate. The former occupant, Yamaha Piano Research Division, was wiped out when an rogue wormhole escaped containment. Not a single building was left behind. You will have eight weeks to complete your contract. Make sure you hit your weekly milestones, or else you and your company will be terminated.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/dac0b30b1d492036aff2a58147a6810b.poster.avif?t=1729345841\" width=442 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/dac0b30b1d492036aff2a58147a6810b.webm?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/dac0b30b1d492036aff2a58147a6810b.mp4?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find synergies between buildings to maximize their taxes, pit mega-corps against idealistic hackers, and place toxic waste dumps on top of coffee shops. Chill out to lo-fi tunes while you grow your city block one cube at a time.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/b04cd96538d31c6b089c56f9733c0d30.poster.avif?t=1729345841\" width=618 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/b04cd96538d31c6b089c56f9733c0d30.webm?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/b04cd96538d31c6b089c56f9733c0d30.mp4?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Congratulations! We have accepted your bid to redevelop Block #27343 inside Novo Stappelstad! This site is truly a blank slate. The former occupant, Yamaha Piano Research Division, was wiped out when an rogue wormhole escaped containment. Not a single building was left behind. You will have eight weeks to complete your contract. Make sure you hit your weekly milestones, or else you and your company will be terminated.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/dac0b30b1d492036aff2a58147a6810b.poster.avif?t=1729345841\" width=442 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/dac0b30b1d492036aff2a58147a6810b.webm?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691050/extras/dac0b30b1d492036aff2a58147a6810b.mp4?t=1729345841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Find synergies between buildings to maximize their taxes, pit mega-corps against idealistic hackers, and place toxic waste dumps on top of coffee shops. Chill out to lo-fi tunes while you grow your city block one cube at a time.",
